name: 12.3-stderr-merge-typed
mapping: typed
spec: 12.3
expect: bash
=== dot ===
digraph {
  make[label="make"] g[label="grep -i error"]
  make:err -> make:out
  make:out -> g }
=== modl ===
make square make
g    square grep -i error
make -> make #gl from=err to=out
make -> g    #gl from=out
=== bash ===
make 2>&1 | grep -i error
